OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 10 MAY
OL,4,G1945FWords and Music
OL,5,     GPoets and composers often in
OL,6,     Gtheir work help us to pay
OL,7,     Gattention and notice the
OL,8,     Goverlooked. In our spotlight
OL,9,     Gtoday: ideas from Walt Whitman,
OL,10,     GDavid Foster Wallace, and Audre
OL,11,     GLorde.
OL,12,G2100FUltimate Calm with Erland Cooper
OL,13,     GEscape with Erland Cooper into
OL,14,     Gour collective imagination
OL,15,     Gthrough a selection of dreamy
OL,16,     Gsounds. And the artist David
OL,17,     GShrigley shares his musical safe
OL,18,     Ghaven.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
